= The judiciary

The minister does not annul another authority’s judgement by naming a policy. The broad variant leads to the one project of democratic guarantees, with its own constitutional procedure.

[+ pl_gc_budget +]

[+ pl_gc_projects +]

- @broad_safeguards
- @limited_redress
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

@broad_safeguards
title: A joint project of democratic guarantees
subtitle: The one democratic_guarantees reform: two main actions, two thirds in both chambers, then 1 B for a month.
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.optionStatus(Q, 'justice_policy', 'broad_safeguards').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_justice_policy_broad_safeguards_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.chooseOption(Q, 'justice_policy', 'broad_safeguards');
!}
go-to: result

@limited_redress
title: Review of a named abuse
subtitle: 1 B for a month; needs an active restriction of a named case. A confirmed unlawful act lifts only that restriction; without grounds the review ends without relief.
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.optionStatus(Q, 'justice_policy', 'limited_redress').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_justice_policy_limited_redress_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.chooseOption(Q, 'justice_policy', 'limited_redress');
!}
go-to: result

